# A6 legacy-page fixtures: byte-for-byte captures of the live WordPress site.
# Reformatting them is editing them — the transform tests assert their measured
# script counts and DOM boundaries. Re-capture, never reformat. (Prettier does
# not merely reformat these: it fails on the theme's unclosed <li> markup.)
src/shared/legacy/__fixtures__/*.html

